\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ data confirms no Aug  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2 -bankers. \b0\par\par\uc2 203 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 September 2000\par 07:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Sept 1 (Reuters) - Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) account data released on Friday showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in August, remaining sidelined for a fourth month in a row, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  They noted the data showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  received no payments from private financial institutions through its special \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account. Such payments are generally viewed as evidence of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in which the BOJ acts as the government's agent. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ was last detected conducting yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on April 3, when the dollar was around 103.30 yen. \par \par \uc2  At that time Japanese authorities said they were concerned an overly rapid appreciation of the yen would be harmful to Japan's nascent economic recovery and they would act in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if needed. \par \par \uc2  Since then the dollar has held largely steady in a 103 to 110 yen range, although recently it has begun weakening again, hitting an eight-week low of 106 yen on Wednesday. In Friday afternoon Tokyo trade it was quoted at 106.44/48 yen, although the euro was hovering just half a yen above its lifetime low of 94.00 yen. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9109abs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
