\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro sags, undermined by losses against yen. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Sabrina Ghani \par \uc2 589 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2000\par 14:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, June 21 (Reuters) - The euro fell across the board, driven by its steep losses against the yen on Wednesday as the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  took the strain of the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's broad-based strength. \par \par \uc2  While wariness of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  tempered the yen's gains against the dollar at 105, which the Japanese authorities have recently hinted they would defend, the euro ended up taking the brunt as traders calculated BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in euro/yen was less likely. \par \par \uc2  The fundamental and technical backdrop was also serving to undermine the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has sliced through key chart support levels this session. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  left interest rates on hold following its regular monetary policy meeting. \par \par \uc2  This was widely expected as senior European officials have recently hinted that the ECB would leave rates steady in coming months following an aggressive 50 basis point hike and introduction of a new variable rate tender regime on June 8. \par \par \uc2  "The euro is looking softer and it has broken below 100 yen which is quite a down move. We have also seen it plunge through $0.9500 which people say is the key chart level," said Mike Moran, treasury economist at Standard Chartered Bank in London. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears are still there but will give better support to dollar/yen than euro/yen. If the BOJ were to interevene it's likely they will do it first in dollar/yen." The euro fell to three-week lows below 100 yen EURJPY=), down about three percent from a two-month high of 103.15 hit on June 14. It hit a low of $0.9464 EUR=), down about 2.5 percent from a high of $0.9701 hit on June 8 when the ECB last hiked. \par \par \uc2  "Euro zone data is strong but it has been in line with expectations. But now people are tempted to test the downside," said a trader at a German bank in Frankfurt. \par \par \uc2  "It's all technically-driven and the ECB meeting is basically a non-event." \par \par \uc2  YEN BENEFITS FROM RATE, ELECTION SPECULATION \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the yen held an upper hand across the board amid persistent speculation that improvement in Japan's economic growth means it will end its zero-rate policy as early as July. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the prospect of Japan's ruling Liberal Democratic Party retaining power following Sunday's election was also underpinning the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "A lot of factors are building up before the weekend and it has to do with optimism that the ruling LDP would scrape through and political stability would continue," said a trader at a Japanese bank in London. \par \par \uc2  "There are also signs of improvement in the Japanese economy, even though it's slow. There is speculation that the Tankan survey (due on July 4) would be better and that the BOJ would end its zero-rate policy in July." \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yen fell as low as 105.18, within 1/4 yen of six-week lows just below 105, it hit on June 7. The dollar has shed about two-percent from highs of around 107.15 yen it set on June 12. \par \par \uc2  An all-industry index released by the Ministry of International Trade and Industry showed that Japanese economic activity contracted by 0.2 percent in April from the previous months. \par \par \uc2  But analysts said the figures did not dent confidence as the key to Japan's recovery was in consumer spending, which has recently shown signs of improvement. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6l034r3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
