\par\par \b \uc2  Japan MOF Kuroda: Will Take Proper  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Steps If Needed \b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juni 2000\par 01:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintained its stance that it will take appropriate measures in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if necessary, Japanese vice finance minister for international affairs Haruhiko Kuroda said Friday. \par \par \uc2  "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate doesn't reflect economic fundamentals, we will take necessary steps," Kuroda told a group of reporters at the ministry. \par \par \uc2  But Kuroda declined to comment on the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the strengthening of the yen. \par \par \uc2  Kuroda's remarks came when market attention was fixed on how Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy will be affected by the January-March gross domestic product data. \par \par \uc2  The Economic Planning Agency announced earlier in the day that the nation's real gross domestic product grew 2.4% in the January-March quarter from the prior quarter - an annual pace of expansion of 10.0%. Japan achieved 0.5% growth on year during the last fiscal year ended March, the EPA noted. \par \par \uc2  Some \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders in Tokyo said despite Kuroda's warning, the possibility of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains slim unless the dollar/yen drops below the Y105.00 level. \par \par \uc2  -By Yukiko Tsuba and Hidenobu Kageyama; 813-5255-2929; hidenobu.kageyama@dowjones.com; yukiko.tsuba@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw6802uha\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
