\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Asia: Japanese, US Economic Trends Underpin Yen Rise \b0\par\par\uc2  By Benjamin Pedley \par \uc2 723 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juni 2000\par 07:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The yen may rally to the key psychological level of Y100 against the dollar by the end of the year if current economic trends in Japan and the U.S. continue, says Richard Hostetter, analyst with WestLB. \par \par \uc2  Hostetter says Japanese economic data, including first quarter capital expenditure issued earlier Wednesday by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , show its economy is picking up, while U.S. non-farm payrolls and the NAPM index for May show U.S. growth is slowing. \par \par \uc2  This perception has attracted capital to Japan, fueling a 5.2% rise in the benchmark Nikkei stock index so far in June, outpacing a 2.0% increase in the Dow Jones Industrial Average. \par \par \uc2  The yen rose as much as 3.5% against the dollar during the same period to a six-week high Tuesday of Y105.20, but has since pulled back to around Y106. \par \par \uc2  If Japanese first quarter machine orders data due Thursday and, more importantly, gross domestic product on Friday confirm the upbeat assessment, the yen likely will extend its recent gains, says the WestLB analyst. \par \par \uc2  Hostetter says the figures may even show surprising strength, which would trigger a larger yen rise, although \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears and uncertainty ahead of a national election on June 25 mean a dramatic move is unlikely in the near-term. \par \par \uc2  "There is some room if GDP comes in stronger, say 12% or more, and in the right kind of way then you will see some downward pressure on the dollar against the yen. What markets are looking for is some kind of strong capex showing goods trends in restructuring and enough trend in consumption," says Hostetter. \par \par \uc2  He forecasts annualized growth of 9.4% on a seasonally adjusted basis in the first quarter, underpinned by growth in residential investment, business investment and to a lesser extent private consumption \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par      Yen Rise May Spark \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The positive trend for Japanese economic growth indicators - and the\par resultant rising yen - could soon force Japanese authorities to again\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets to curb yen strength.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to weaken the yen on March 8 when\par the dollar was trading above Y106. Heavy yen sales in November, December\par and January helped the dollar remain above the Y101.25/Y101.30 region.\par It then peaked at Y111.73 in February.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There is some positive momentum in Japanese economic numbers after\par some weakness, and it will be hard for the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to\par confront these figures as the yen too has been on an upward trend," says\par Hostetter.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may be more difficult for the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par according to rumors circulating in Tokyo financial markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Banks may be afraid to take large \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  orders from the Bank of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  due to its recent ban on Merrill Lynch from such activities, which\par generated adverse publicity and unwanted attention for the U.S.\par institution.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Financial market talk is the BOJ might have greater difficulty\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  due to a reduced number of banks prepared to execute its\par orders.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par While the BoJ is unlikely to face any serious problems in this area,\par according to Hostetter, the rumors might encourage speculators to test\par the BOJ's resolve.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He says the upcoming national election will also continue to restrict\par the short-term upside potential for the Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Political factors and those \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fears will continue to weigh\par on sentiment and make it unlikely that people will buy the yen too\par aggressively for now."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Hostetter says the most likely outcome from the poll is the ruling\par Liberal Democratic Party coalition will retain power with a vastly\par reduced margin.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "And if it loses enough seats, that will be a signal to the LDP that\par it can't keep Prime Minister Yoshiro Mori as leader," he says.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "If it has to choose a new PM and cabinet that could be unsettling for\par markets...and prevent a big yen rise, which may be warranted by economic\par trends."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With less than three weeks to go before the election in the powerful\par lower house of Parliament, Mori's approval ratings have plummeted to\par less than 20% from around 40% in April after he replaced the late Prime\par Minister Keizo Obuchi.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Benjamin Pedley; 65-421-4485; ben.pedley@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4258 5095 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw6702tan\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
