\par\par \b \uc2  Euro plunges on ECB nonchalance, U.S. stock rise. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Ayumi Moriyama \par \uc2 870 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 April 2000\par 04:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      TOKYO, April 26 (Reuters) - The ailing euro sagged to a \par \par \uc2  record low against the yen on Wednesday morning as sentiment \par \par \uc2  soured amid an air of nonchalance from European officials and \par \par \uc2  Wall Street's surge overnight. \par \par \uc2      The European single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sank to 97.08 yen with dealers \par \par \uc2  reporting heavy selling from Japanese institutions and U.S banks, \par \par \uc2  dragging along the dollar to around 105.65 yen with offers from \par \par \uc2  Japanese institutions and exporters at around 106. \par \par \uc2      "Euro sentiment is very very bad," a dealer at a major \par \par \uc2  Japanese city bank said. "At times like this, (European) \par \par \uc2  officials need to send a strong message to the market to protect \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by bringing up, for instance, the notion of \par \par \uc2  concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2      The euro recovered to 97.14/22 yen by 0210 GMT, though that \par \par \uc2  was still well down from 97.90 in late U.S. trade. Against the \par \par \uc2  dollar, it stood at $0.9189/93 up from a record low of $0.9162 \par \par \uc2  set overnight and $0.9208 in late U.S. trade. \par \par \uc2      The dollar stood at 105.70/73 yen, down from 106.30 yen in \par \par \uc2  late New York trading. \par \par \uc2      The greenback was supported, however, by the tech-heavy \par \par \uc2  Nasdaq index jumping 6.57 percent overnight, while the blue-chip \par \par \uc2  Dow Jones industrial average climbed 2.01 percent. \par \par \uc2      Many dealers were wary of the possibility of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  (BOJ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the yen from strengthening too much \par \par \uc2  against the euro. \par \par \uc2      But at the same time, they doubted such action for the time \par \par \uc2  being as the level of the yen against the dollar was still \par \par \uc2  comfortably near 106 yen. \par \par \uc2      "The BOJ could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying dollars against the yen to \par \par \uc2  support the euro/yen cross, but it would be difficult to get the \par \par \uc2  consent of the United States and Europe," another city bank \par \par \uc2  dealer said. \par \par \uc2      The BOJ is in a tough position as dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  would boost the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the euro. \par \par \uc2      Japanese monetary officials have so far said nothing on \par \par \uc2  Wednesday regarding \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the euro faced an array of stop-loss selling \par \par \uc2  triggers below its record lows against both the dollar and the \par \par \uc2  yen, and that speculators were expected to test them at any time. \par \par \uc2      "The euro was heavily affected by comments from several \par \par \uc2  German officials who have, if you like, reaffirmed their \par \par \uc2  unclearness over the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Karl Broecker, Treasury Head at \par \par \uc2  Landesbank Baden-Wuerttenberg in Singapore told Reuters \par \par \uc2  Television. \par \par \uc2      He singled out German Economics Minister Werner Mueller's \par \par \uc2  comment as especially damaging. \par \par \uc2      Mueller said he was not worried by the euro's new lows, \par \par \uc2  insisting instead that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's internal strength is key. \par \par \uc2      Germany's Finance Minister Hans Eichel, meanwhile, once again \par \par \uc2  said the markets would eventually recognise the 11 nations' \par \par \uc2  strong growth rates. \par \par \uc2      Even though the euro was technically oversold, Broecker felt \par \par \uc2  rallies would be muted. That's because as it crashed from 93.50 \par \par \uc2  to 91.60, many traders would have been caught out and would be \par \par \uc2  praying for a bounce in order to exit long euro positions. \par \par \uc2  Dealers and analysts said the battered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely \par \par \uc2  to receive much of a boost even if the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  (ECB) decides to raise interest rates at its policy-setting \par \par \uc2  meeting on Thursday. \par \par \uc2      "If they move if would not help the euro, it would only be a \par \par \uc2  sign of distress at this stage," Broecker said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 0212GMT.  All data taken from Reuters \par \par \uc2  with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. close at \par \par \uc2  2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab      Last     US Close  % Chg  YTD %   1999 Cls\par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab   25 Apr.\par \tab \tab \tab      -----------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Euro/dlr   0.9189   0.9208   -0.21    -8.75   1.0070\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Dlr/yen    105.70   106.30   -0.56    +3.41   102.21\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Euro/yen   97.12    97.90   -0.80    -5.80   103.10\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Dlr/swiss  1.7101   1.7077   +0.14    +7.54   1.5902\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Stg/dlr    1.5795   1.5810   -0.09    -2.36   1.6176\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Can/dlr    1.4682   1.4675   +0.05    +1.57   1.4455\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Aus